{"3152600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cave Of Horrors", "steam_appid": 3152600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the secrets of the cave or face your fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling adventure, you step into the shoes of a death row inmate given one last chance to avoid execution. Your task? To explore the uncharted depths of a perilous cave and document its mysteries. This is no ordinary cave—it's teeming with bizarre creatures, unusual plants, and mysterious ores, each with unique properties waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore and Document</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary goal is to investigate every nook and cranny of the cave, leaving no stone unturned. The cave is a labyrinthine ecosystem brimming with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters: </strong>Each with unique behaviors and vulnerabilities. Use your wits to understand how different ores affect them and log every detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/7cb9122cce5e2ad1f6b3634bd80a5fa7.poster.avif?t=1761587162\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/7cb9122cce5e2ad1f6b3634bd80a5fa7.webm?t=1761587162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/7cb9122cce5e2ad1f6b3634bd80a5fa7.mp4?t=1761587162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plants:</strong> Discover various plants, each with distinctive effects when consumed. Some might enhance your abilities, others could provide essential clues, but all are crucial to your survival and documentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ores:</strong> Collect ores that possess special properties when thrown. These ores can create strategic advantages against monsters or help solve intricate puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Points of Interest:</strong> Every hidden corner, ancient relic, and mysterious artifact must be thoroughly explored and recorded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.poster.avif?t=1761587162\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.webm?t=1761587162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.mp4?t=1761587162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong> The cave is riddled with puzzles that guard its secrets. Use your intellect and the tools at your disposal to unlock these mysteries and progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of survival as you delve deeper into the cave's enigmatic environment. Your logbook isn't just a record—it's your lifeline. Accurately noting how ores interact with monsters and the effects of plants can mean the difference between life and death.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the secrets of the cave or face your fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 