tages against monsters or help solve intricate puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Points of Interest:</strong> Every hidden corner, ancient relic, and mysterious artifact must be thoroughly explored and recorded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.poster.avif?t=1761587162\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.webm?t=1761587162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.mp4?t=1761587162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong> The cave is riddled with puzzles that guard its secrets. Use your intellect and the tools at your disposal to unlock these mysteries and progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of survival as you delve deeper into the cave's enigmatic environment. Your logbook isn't just a record—it's your lifeline. Accurately noting how ores interact with monsters and the effects of plants can mean the difference between life and death.</p>", "short_description": "Explore and discover the secrets of a non-linear cave. Document everything you find in your logbook. You cannot return unless you find every single information about every monster, plant, ore and point of interest.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app